<title>USA: Rudy's Restaurant Q1 Dec 22 full results.</title>
<headline>Rudy's Restaurant Q1 Dec 22 full results.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter Ended	   Dec. 22, 1996	Dec. 24, 1995</p>
<p> Revenues			     $3,604,000	   $2,518,000</p>
<p> Net Income				240,276		240,071</p>
<p> EPS					     .06		    .06</p>
<p> Pre-tax earnings			396,276		256,411</p>
<p> Pre-tax EPS				   .11		    .07</p>
<p>Note: Rudy's Restaurant Group Inc presently operates six Samurai and three Kyoto Japanese steak and seafood restaurants in seven major metropolitan areas throughout the United States.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
